###Pure
Class {meta::pure::profiles::doc.doc = 'One public-library catalogue record with a deliberately wide flat scalar shape: forty-eight descriptive strings, seven circulation integers, five physical or quality floats and four lifecycle timestamps.'} test::lunarwillow5::domain::CatalogueRecord
{
  catalogueCode: String[1];
  title: String[1];
  subtitle: String[1];
  authorName: String[1];
